   "subject": "Re: [methylkit_discussion] Problems using methRead with input from bismark",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi Nuria,<br><br>Pass a list instead of a vector in the argument &quot;location&quot;:<br>location = list(&quot;sample1_CpG.txt&quot;, &quot;sample2_CpG.txt&quot;, &quot;sample3_CpG.txt&quot;)<br><br></div>NB: About lists and vectors for arguments in methylKit, note that the function methylKit:::readMethylBaseDB requires a vector and not a list for the argument sample.ids while all other functions I tested so far with a sample.ids argument require a list.<br><div><br>Best<br>Johan<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><br></span></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On 12 July 2018 at 15:21, Serra, Nuria <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">nuria...@gmi.oeaw.ac.at</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,Helvetica,EmojiFont,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,NotoColorEmoji,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Android Emoji&quot;,EmojiSymbols\" dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">Hello, </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"><br>\r\n</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">I am trying to read methylation calls from sorted Bismark alignments, but I get an error. </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"><br>\r\n</p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">I first use the function processBismarkAln to produce methylation call files for each sample, e.g:</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"></p>\r\n<div>sample1 = processBismarkAln(location = &quot;sample1_pe.sorted.bam&quot;,</div>\r\n<div>                              <a href=\"http://sample.id\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://sample.id&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793231813682000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1ikvYJzzD5YSxBH398EzF_\">sample.id</a> = &quot;sample1&quot;, </div>\r\n<div>                              assembly=&quot;tair9&quot;, </div>\r\n<div>                              save.context= c(&quot;CpG&quot;, &quot;CHG&quot;, &quot;CHH&quot;),</div>\r\n<div>                              read.context = &quot;none&quot;, </div>\r\n<div>                              save.folder=getwd(), </div>\r\n<div>                              mincov = 3, </div>\r\n<div>                              save.db = TRUE)</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>And then I use the function methRead to create a methylrawList with all samples per context, e.g:</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>samples_CG = methRead(location = c(&quot;sample1_CpG.txt&quot;, &quot;sample2_CpG.txt&quot;, &quot;sample3_CpG.txt&quot;<span style=\"font-size:12pt\">),</span></div>\r\n<div>                      assembly = &quot;tair9&quot;,</div>\r\n<div>                      dbtype = &quot;tabix&quot;,</div>\r\n<div>                      pipeline = &quot;bismark&quot;,</div>\r\n<div>                      context = &quot;CpG&quot;,</div>\r\n<div>                      resolution = &quot;base&quot;, </div>\r\n<div>                      dbdir = getwd(),</div>\r\n<div>                      mincov = 3 )</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>But I get the error:</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p style=\"margin-right:0px;margin-left:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;background-color:rgb(254,244,156)\">\r\n<span>Error in (function (classes, fdef, mtable)<span>  </span>:<span> </span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-right:0px;margin-left:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;background-color:rgb(254,244,156)\">\r\n<span><span>  </span>unable to find an inherited method for function ‘methRead’ for signature ‘&quot;character&quot;, &quot;missing&quot;, &quot;character&quot;’</span></p>\r\n<div><span><br>\r\n</span></div>\r\nThe head of the files looks like: </div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font:12px &quot;Andale Mono&quot;;color:rgb(40,254,20);background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9)\">\r\n<span>chrBase<span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">\r\n</span>chr<span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> </span>base<span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">\r\n</span>strand<span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> </span>coverage<span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">\r\n</span>freqC<span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> </span>freqT</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font:12px &quot;Andale Mono&quot;;color:rgb(40,254,20);background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9)\">\r\n<span>Chr1.1000036<span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">\r\n</span>Chr1<span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> </span>1000036<span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">\r\n</span>F<span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> </span>7<span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">\r\n</span>0.00<span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> </span>100.00</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font:12px &quot;Andale Mono&quot;;color:rgb(40,254,20);background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9)\">\r\n<span>Chr1.1000069<span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">\r\n</span>Chr1<span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> </span>1000069<span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">\r\n</span>F<span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> </span>6<span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">\r\n</span>0.00<span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> </span>100.00</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font:12px &quot;Andale Mono&quot;;color:rgb(40,254,20);background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9)\">\r\n<span>Chr1.1000113<span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">\r\n</span>Chr1<span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> </span>1000113<span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">\r\n</span>F<span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> </span>5<span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">\r\n</span>0.00<span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> </span>100.00</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font:12px &quot;Andale Mono&quot;;color:rgb(40,254,20);background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9)\">\r\n<span>Chr1.1000118<span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">\r\n</span>Chr1<span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> </span>1000118<span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">\r\n</span>F<span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> </span>5<span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">\r\n</span>0.00<span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> </span>100.00</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font:12px &quot;Andale Mono&quot;;color:rgb(40,254,20);background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9)\">\r\n<span>Chr1.1000170<span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">\r\n</span>Chr1<span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> </span>1000170<span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">\r\n</span>F<span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> </span>11<span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">\r\n</span>0.00<span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> </span>100.00</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font:12px &quot;Andale Mono&quot;;color:rgb(40,254,20);background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.9)\">\r\n<span>Chr1.1000178<span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">\r\n</span>Chr1<span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> </span>1000178<span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">\r\n</span>F<span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> </span>11<span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">\r\n</span>0.00<span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> </span>100.00</span></p>\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>What is the problem? </div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Thank you, </div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Best regards,</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Núria</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<br>\r\n<p></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<font style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;FONT-FAMILY:Cabin\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;FONT-FAMILY:Cabin\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;FONT-FAMILY:Cabin\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt\">\r\n<p style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;FONT-FAMILY:ARIAL\"><font style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;FONT-FAMILY:Cabin\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;FONT-FAMILY:Cabin\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;FONT-FAMILY:Cabin\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt\">Nuria Serra</span><br style=\"FONT-FAMILY:Cabin\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY:Cabin\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY:Cabin\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt\"></span></strong><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY:Cabin\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt\">Intern</span><br style=\"FONT-FAMILY:Cabin\"></font></span></span></font><font style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;FONT-FAMILY:Cabin\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt\"></span><br style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;FONT-FAMILY:Cabin\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt\">Gregor \r\nMendel Institute of Molecular Plant Biology GmbH</span><br style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;FONT-FAMILY:Cabin\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt\">Dr. \r\nBohr-Gasse 3, 1030 Vienna, Austria</span><br style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;FONT-FAMILY:Cabin\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt\"></span></font><a style=\"FONT-SIZE:10pt;FONT-FAMILY:Cabin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><font