     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br>Hi <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,Helvetica,EmojiFont,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,NotoColorEmoji,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Android Emoji&quot;,EmojiSymbols;font-size:16px\">Núria,</span><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif, Helvetica, EmojiFont, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, NotoColorEmoji, Segoe UI Symbol, Android Emoji, EmojiSymbols\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif, Helvetica, EmojiFont, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, NotoColorEmoji, Segoe UI Symbol, Android Emoji, EmojiSymbols\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">from the error message and your code I guess that you missed to add the list of sample.ids. <br><br>And Johan is right, the locations should also be passed as list:</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif, Helvetica, EmojiFont, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, NotoColorEmoji, Segoe UI Symbol, Android Emoji, EmojiSymbols\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><br></span></font><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div>samples_CG = methRead(location = list(&quot;sample1_CpG.txt&quot;, &quot;sample2_CpG.txt&quot;, &quot;sample3_CpG.txt&quot;),<br>                      <a href=\"http://sample.id\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://sample.id&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793231813686000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0F0rQwY1DBHmuDfVlle2xw\">sample.id</a> = list(&quot;sample1&quot;, &quot;sample2&quot;, &quot;sample3&quot;),</div></code></div></div></div>"
